    {
      "id": "49b91dd8-48a4-48c6-a4ec-f12ad92070cc",
      "description": "No. The Basic plan carries no subscription \u2014 no credit card required. You only need a card when you move to a paid plan."
    },
    {
      "id": "3f462914-98d4-4790-9ffc-a32f88b20acf",
      "description": "A custom domain is a paid-plan feature. Connect your existing domain and complete DNS setup; on Basic your site runs on a KrabiClaw subdomain."
    },
    {
      "id": "94bd280c-2144-4a2e-b2e3-31bee83845b9",
      "description": "During onboarding, import a selected business snapshot from Google Places. An eligible paid plan also supports connecting a Place, manually refreshing details, and a weekly refresh of reviews and ratings."
    }
